club or other non-commercial community, and that is not open to public sign-up
by anyone on the internet.

"Competing Product" means any software, service, or application that provides
similar functionality to the Software, including but not limited to chat
applications, communication platforms, and social networking services, that is
offered to the general public or used for Commercial Use. A Personal Instance is
not a Competing Product.

